# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true hands Windows checkouts CRLF, and
# golangci-lint's gofmt formatter reports those files as unformatted while the
# gofmt CLI does not — so local lint disagrees with CI for reasons that have
# nothing to do with the code.
*.go            text eol=lf
*.mod           text eol=lf
*.sum           text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.md            text eol=lf
.env.example    text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.sh            text eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF; cmd.exe is unreliable with LF-only batch files.
*.bat           text eol=crlf

*.webp          binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
